{"id":8792671,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/3595","number":3595,"state":"merged","title":"fix: FusedMulAddAdd infershape 适配 op_proto，输出取 x1 shape 且不支持动态 shape","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3595","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3595/issues","body":"## 描述\n\n将 `FusedMulAddAdd` 的 infershape 实现从通用广播推导（`Ops::Base::InferShape4Broadcast`）改为与 op_proto 契约一致的语义：\n\n- **输出 shape 取 x1 的 shape**：op_proto（`fused_mul_add_add_proto.h`）规定 `y` 与 `x1` 具有相同 dtype 和 shape，x1 承载完整输出 shape，x2/x3/x4 向 x1 广播；运行时要求 x1 必须为完整输出 shape，x1 自身需要被广播放大的场景不支持。原 `InferShape4Broadcast` 对四输入做相互广播，与该契约不一致。\n- **不支持动态 shape**：对四个输入逐一空指针校验后，若任一输入为 unknown rank(-2) 或 unknown shape(-1)，打印告警并返回 `GRAPH_FAILED`。\n- 头文件依赖从 `infershape_broadcast_util.h` 切换为 `op_common/op_host/util/shape_util.h`（提供 `IsUnknownRank` / `IsUnknownShape`）。\n\n### 改动原因\n\ninfershape 此前使用通用广播推导，输出为四输入广播结果且接受动态 shape，与 op_proto 声明的「y 与 x1 同 shape、x1 即完整输出 shape、不支持 x1 被广播放大」契约不一致，会在 x1 小于其他输入或动态 shape 场景推导出错误的输出 shape。本次将 infershape 对齐 op_proto。\n\n### 改动方法\n\n`math/fused_mul_add_add/op_host/fused_mul_add_add_infershape.cpp`：取 x1~x4 的 InputShape 并空指针校验 → 任一输入动态 shape/rank 即返回 `GRAPH_FAILED` → 否则 `*yShape = *x1Shape` 返回 `GRAPH_SUCCESS`。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n\n- #2074 （https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues/2074）\n\n## 测试\n\n更新 `math/fused_mul_add_add/tests/ut/op_host/test_fused_mul_add_add_infershape.cpp`：\n\n- 广播相关用例（Case 3/9/10/11/12/13）期望输出从「广播结果」改为「x1 的 shape」；\n- 动态 shape（Case 5，-1）与动态 rank（Case 6，-2）期望从 `GRAPH_SUCCESS` 改为 `GRAPH_FAILED`，输出 shape 置空。\n\n## 文档更新\n\n无\n\n## 类型标签\n\n- [x] Bug修复\n","assignees_number":0,"assignees":[],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[],"labels":[{"id":4929,"color":"#2865E0","name":"cann-cla/yes","repository_id":7649531,"created_at":"2025-06-21T10:53:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T10:53:24+08:00"},{"id":22553,"color":"#3ee029","name":"api-check-pass","repository_id":7649531,"created_at":"2025-12-16T09: